{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ battery at %lld%%" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ battery at %lld%%"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Batería de %@ al %lld %%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Auto activation.** When the alarm is on, the Halo arms itself as soon as you leave your bike, and disarms when you come back near it with this iPhone. It doesn't arm while charging." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Auto activation.** When the alarm is on, the Halo arms itself as soon as you leave your bike, and disarms when you come back near it with this iPhone. It doesn't arm while charging."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Activación automática.** Con la alarma activada, el Halo se arma en cuanto te alejas de la bici y se desarma cuando vuelves con este iPhone. No se arma mientras está cargando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Manual activation.** Phone out of battery? Tap your tap code on the Halo's touch surface to arm or disarm the alarm." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Manual activation.** Phone out of battery? Tap your tap code on the Halo's touch surface to arm or disarm the alarm."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "**Activación manual.** ¿Móvil sin batería? Marca tu código de toques en la superficie táctil del Halo para armar o desarmar la alarma."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A simulated Halo — every feature is safe to try. “Simulate alarm” walks away, moves the bike and comes back (turn the alarm on first): you get the recap. “Simulate re-pair” walks you through the recovery wizard." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A simulated Halo — every feature is safe to try. “Simulate alarm” walks away, moves the bike and comes back (turn the alarm on first): you get the recap. “Simulate re-pair” walks you through the recovery wizard."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un Halo simulado: puedes probarlo todo sin riesgo. «Simular alarma» se aleja, mueve la bici y vuelve (activa antes la alarma): verás el resumen. «Simular reemparejado» te guía por el asistente de recuperación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
