      }
    },
    "The ring only accepts the password this app set during recovery. Save a copy in your password manager: if it's lost, recovering again needs a cold reboot of the ring. iCloud Keychain sync needs iCloud Keychain turned on, and may not work with free-account (SideStore) signing. Another iPhone tries synced passwords automatically." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ring only accepts the password this app set during recovery. Save a copy in your password manager: if it's lost, recovering again needs a cold reboot of the ring. iCloud Keychain sync needs iCloud Keychain turned on, and may not work with free-account (SideStore) signing. Another iPhone tries synced passwords automatically."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El anillo solo acepta la contraseña que fijó esta app al recuperarlo. Guarda una copia en tu gestor de contraseñas: si se pierde, recuperarlo otra vez exige un reinicio en frío del anillo. La sincronización necesita el Llavero de iCloud activado y puede no funcionar con firma de cuenta gratuita (SideStore). Otro iPhone prueba automáticamente las contraseñas sincronizadas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
