    "Your tap code lets you arm and disarm the alarm should your phone run out of battery. Just tap the Morse-like code on the Halo's touch surface." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your tap code lets you arm and disarm the alarm should your phone run out of battery. Just tap the Morse-like code on the Halo's touch surface."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu código de toques te permite armar y desarmar la alarma si tu móvil se queda sin batería. Solo tienes que marcar el código, como en Morse, en la superficie táctil del Halo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• short tap, — long press, on the Halo's top while it's connected to this iPhone. A single tap is the easiest to make by accident." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• short tap, — long press, on the Halo's top while it's connected to this iPhone. A single tap is the easiest to make by accident."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• toque corto, — pulsación larga, sobre el Halo mientras está conectado a este iPhone. Un toque suelto es el más fácil de hacer sin querer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
